  "description": "Wrapper for mozilla/sccache — a shared compilation cache that drops in transparently via RUSTC_WRAPPER. Caches rustc outputs across CI runs (and C/C++ compiles too) keyed by source hash + flags + dep hashes. Backends: local disk, S3, Azure Blob, GCS, Redis, memcached, GitHub Actions cache. Turns the cold-CI Rust-compile bottleneck into a warm-cache lookup. Pairs with Tamp.Cargo for the Rust toolchain side.",
